Stealmoji for Revenge, adaptation dated 2026-10-01.

Based on Stealmoji by Fiery and pylix, and aliernfrog's mobile fork:
https://github.com/Fierdetta/stealmoji
https://github.com/aliernfrog/vd-plugins/tree/main/plugins/Stealmoji

The supplied vd-plugins-main.zip identifies upstream commit
fe43f5dc2b0880c95edd3787331e252f2ba1e280.

Original author credits are preserved in the manifest. This adaptation replaces
the old nested render patches, shared dialogs, and upload handling with guarded
per-opening wrappers, a standalone settings/picker UI, validated downloads,
lifecycle cleanup, and regression tests. Published by fluttershy_simper.

